    {
      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "Experiments on mathematical reasoning and code-generation benchmarks demonstrate that G2 RPO-A substantially outperforms vanilla GRPO and simple guided baselines. The <strong>guidance ratio</strong> and <strong>guidance length</strong> have significant impacts on performance, with larger models benefiting from weaker guidance and code tasks requiring higher guidance ratios. The adaptive scheme in G2 RPO-A achieves the best scores on almost every model-benchmark pair.",
