    {
      "title": "Why It Matters",
      "content": "G2 RPO-A addresses the scalability challenge in enhancing reasoning capabilities across diverse model sizes, making it a pivotal advancement in the field of artificial intelligence. By retaining tough examples and attaching adaptive guidance to them, G2 RPO-A exploits the full difficulty spectrum without sacrificing performance, outperforming sample-filtering methods that remove or substitute hard samples.",
